881853857","created_at":"Fri Sep 18 16:53:30 +0000 2026","display_text_range":[0,140],"entities":{"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"864751444586397696","indices":[3,16],"name":"防衛省統合幕僚監部","screen_name":"jointstaffpa"}]},"favorite_count":0,"favorited":false,"full_text":"RT @jointstaffpa: ９月１５日、白川統幕副長は、第３回　日ASEAN WPS協力プロジェクトに参加し、挨拶を述べました。また、９月１５日～１７日、統幕ジェンダーアドバイザー中田１空佐は、本プロジェクトにグループ討議の教官として参加しました。… https://t…","id_str":"2100991614881853857","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":39,"retweeted":false,"retweeted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3295},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730044368902615040/7w8jWTpY_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/864751444586397696/1576143970"},"core":{"created_at":"Wed May 17 07:56:25 +0000 2017","name":"防衛省統合幕僚監部","screen_name":"jointstaffpa"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo4NjQ3NTE0NDQ1ODYzOTc2OTY=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"統合幕僚監部の公式アカウントです。陸・海・空自衛隊の運用を司る統合幕僚監部は、厳しさを増す安全保障環境の中、それぞれが行う我が国周辺の警戒監視・対領空侵犯措置、海外での任務（海賊対処行動など）、災害派遣、そしてあらゆる事態に備えての統合演習など統合幕僚監部ならではのプロフェッショナルな活動状況をお伝えしています。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp/js/","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/js/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/Rh7kA16rwk"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts